    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your Action Surge, you can choose allies in a 30-foot Emanation originating from you, up to a number equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). Each can immediately take a Reaction to use one of the following options.</p><p><strong>Attack.</strong> The ally makes one attack with a weapon or an Unarmed Strike.</p><p><strong>Move.</strong> The ally moves up to half its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
